      "text": "The word “vector” has become one of the most important concepts in modern AI.Hindsight, the open-source agent memory system from @vectorizeio, is a strong example — built so agents can learn over time rather than simply recall conversation history. It has 55k+ GitHub stars: https://t.co/Jyo5eRJ0bK",
