      "text": "AI for Software Engineers Lesson 41: Context Engineering\n\nPrompt engineering is about wording. Context engineering is about what's in the window at all.\n\nThe shift:\nEarly AI work was \"how do I phrase the prompt?\"\nModern AI work is \"what information should the model have in front",
      "url": "https://x.com/askarthemass/status/2114937635479142589"
