      "text": "Forget knowledge graphs and memory consolidation. A paper published this week shows a plain RAG baseline, called RAW-RAG, beating six more sophisticated agent memory systems on their own benchmarks, in six of seven benchmark and model combinations across four test sets including https://t.co/VuehcUJBLL",
