      "text": "New paper (RAW-RAG, arxiv 2610.30755): plain retrieval over raw chat history beat elaborate agent memory systems in 6 of 7 settings. Compressing chats into tidy memories breaks the connections answers depend on. Before buying memory infra, ask what the simple baseline scores.",
